#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The RNU is torn between the question of ideological doctrine and pragmatism. Which course should we sway the party towards?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @left: We are still a socialist party above all else! We should still act like one!
- @centrist: There is no need to sway the boat, our steady course has done us well so far.
- @right: We should consider more pragmatic approaches to saving democracy, even if it means we need to change our rhetoric and views.
- @easy_discard

@left
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 10; communist_coalition += 1; left_dissent -= 5; rlrp_relation -= 3; lcpr_relation -= 5; rnkp _relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; rkp_relation += 3; su_relation +=5;

The left wing of our party want us to reconcile with the left, limit our cooperation with he right as much as possible and ensure we remain committed to class struggle.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The centrist faction of our party are dedicated to keeping our steady course that has led us so far.


@reform
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "reformist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "reformist"; reformist_strength += 10; democratization += 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; rlrp_relation += 5; rnkp_relation += 5; lcpr_relation += 5; rkp_relation -= 5;moderate_plan_support += 1

The right wing of our party seeks strategic cooperation with the right and is more willing to compromise on our values for the greater good of democracy. 

@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
